---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import BlogHeader from '../components/blog/BlogHeader.astro';
import FormattedDate from '../components/FormattedDate.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import '../styles/studio.css';

const notes = (await getCollection('fieldNotes')).sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf());
const builds = (await getCollection('builds')).filter((build) => !build.data.draft);
const featured = notes.find((note) => note.data.featured) ?? notes[0];
const latest = notes.slice(0, 3);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head><BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description="一个公开记录 AI Agent 学习、实验与构建过程的个人实验室。" /></head>
  <body class="studio-page">
    <BlogHeader theme="dark" />
    <main class="studio-shell studio-main">
      <section class="studio-hero">
        <div>
          <div class="studio-kicker"><span class="studio-kicker-dot"></span> AI agent lab / public worklog</div>
          <h1>Building agents<br /><em>that can explain themselves.</em></h1>
          <p class="studio-hero-lede">这里记录我如何理解、实验和构建 AI Agent：从检索和工具调用开始，走向可观察、可评测、值得信任的系统。</p>
          <div class="studio-actions"><a class="studio-button studio-button-primary" href="/field-notes/">Open field notes ↗</a><a class="studio-button studio-button-ghost" href="/now/">See what’s now</a></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="studio-console" aria-label="当前状态"><div class="studio-console-label">System status</div><div class="studio-console-title"><span class="studio-kicker-dot" style="display:inline-block; margin-right:8px"></span> Learning in public</div><ul class="studio-console-list"><li><span>Current focus</span><strong>Agent systems</strong></li><li><span>Active tracks</span><strong>03</strong></li><li><span>Next experiment</span><strong class="is-live">Tool call trace</strong></li><li><span>Builds shipped</span><strong>{String(builds.length).padStart(2, '0')}</strong></li></ul></aside>
      </section>

      <section class="studio-section" aria-labelledby="portals-title"><div class="studio-section-heading"><div><div class="studio-section-label">Navigate the lab</div><h2 id="portals-title">Follow the signal.</h2></div><p>四个入口，分别记录理解、验证、构建和当下。</p></div><div class="studio-portal-grid"><a class="studio-portal" href="/field-notes/"><div class="studio-portal-top"><span class="studio-portal-index">01 / notes</span><span class="studio-portal-arrow">↗</span></div><div><h3>Field Notes</h3><p>概念、阅读和正在形成的判断。</p></div></a><a class="studio-portal" href="/experiments/"><div class="studio-portal-top"><span class="studio-portal-index">02 / lab</span><span class="studio-portal-arrow">↗</span></div><div><h3>Experiments</h3><p>把问题变成可以操作和观察的实验。</p></div></a><a class="studio-portal" href="/builds/"><div class="studio-portal-top"><span class="studio-portal-index">03 / shipped</span><span class="studio-portal-arrow">↗</span></div><div><h3>Builds</h3><p>已经运行、测量和交付的系统。</p></div></a></div></section>

      {featured && <section class="studio-section" aria-labelledby="featured-title"><div class="studio-section-heading"><div><div class="studio-section-label">Featured field note</div><h2 id="featured-title">Start with evidence.</h2></div><p>第一篇记录从 RAG 开始：回答之前，先找到证据。</p></div><div class="studio-feature-grid"><article class="studio-feature"><a href={`/field-notes/${featured.id}/`}><div class="studio-feature-meta"><span class="studio-tag">{featured.data.type}</span>{featured.data.tags.map((tag) => <span class="studio-tag">#{tag}</span>)}</div><h3>{featured.data.title} ↗</h3><p>{featured.data.description}</p></a></article><aside class="studio-now-card"><div class="studio-card-label">The loop</div><h3>Observe → decide → call → verify</h3><p>Agent 的可靠性来自过程可见，而不是一句“它应该能完成”。</p><ul class="studio-now-list"><li>Trace the decision</li><li>Keep the evidence</li><li>Measure the result</li></ul></aside></div></section>}

      <section class="studio-section" aria-labelledby="latest-title"><div class="studio-section-heading"><div><div class="studio-section-label">Latest signal</div><h2 id="latest-title">Recent notes.</h2></div><a class="studio-button studio-button-ghost" href="/field-notes/">All field notes ↗</a></div><div class="studio-note-grid">{latest.map((note) => <a class="studio-note-card" href={`/field-notes/${note.id}/`}><div class="studio-card-label">{note.data.type}</div><h3>{note.data.title}</h3><p>{note.data.description}</p><div class="studio-note-card-footer"><span><FormattedDate date={note.data.pubDate} /></span><span>↗</span></div></a>)}</div></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="studio-shell studio-footer"><span>Tend / AI agent lab</span><span><a href="/now/">Now</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/games/">Personal archive</a></span></footer>
  </body>
</html>
